<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 700 mln 2-yr, 5-yr bonds Jan 16.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 700 mln 2-yr, 5-yr bonds Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish treasury offered to sell 700 million zlotys of two-year, 16-percent and five-year, 12-percent fixed bonds at a primary tender on January 16, 1997, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The value dates at this auction are February 5, 1997 for the two-year bonds, maturing on February 12, 1999, and February 12, 1997 for the five-year paper, due February 12, 2002.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
